.#-----------------------------------------------------
.input|markdown/1.2
.# Code spans and code blocks generated for verbatim located in headings, list items, quotations and table cells
.# (see verbatim5.test) are read back with the same content.
.#-----------------------------------------------------
# Heading ``a`b``

* item `x*y`
    * nested `multi line`

>  quote `[[not a link]]`

| head `a|b` |         head2         |
| ---------- | --------------------- |
| cell `c|d` | `block in table cell` |

* <div>

  ```
  block in list
  ```

  </div>
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|event/1.0
